WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.800
Two massive unidentified objects
appeared yesterday at Fostarosa Peir,

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.670
causing great damage in the area.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.470
Fortunately, however, no deaths
or injuries have been confirmed,

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:16.760
and I am very much relieved
to know that no lives were lost.

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:21.270
I am sure that you, our citizens,
must be most disquieted.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.940
However, I ask that you persevere,

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:30.650
and calmly go about living
your lives as you have before.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:35.240
I am always with you.

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:39.660
Let us join hands, and continue to
show compassion for one another,

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.410
so that we may bring about a speedy recovery

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:46.080
and take back our peaceful lives.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:49.250
We will now accept questions
from members of the press.

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:51.960
Photos of yesterday's incident
seem to suggest a connection to

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:55.590
the Fall of Rimgarde 12 years ago.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.970
Does Your Majesty care to comment on this?

00:00:58.180 --> 00:00:59.800
I still do not know.

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:02.770
We are currently investigating
the possibility of a connection.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:06.690
Does Your Majesty think
these objects will appear again?

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:13.860
I will refrain from expressing
my personal opinion;

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:17.780
however, if they harm our country,

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:20.200
we will do everything in our
power to deal with them.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:25.200
If that is all, we will conclude the conference.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:32.420
Ah, excuse me, may I ask what
Your Majesty's three sizes are?

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:33.170
Huh?

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:34.380
What?!

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:05.250
All right, I will answer your question.

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:10.000
My three sizes are...

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:45.590
Yep, speaking in front of everyone
makes me pretty nervous!

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:45.930
Why would you answer a question like that?

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:53.560
I just wanted to answer any questions I could...

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:54.690
Still...

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:55.230
It did have the helpful effect
of changing the subject.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:04.740
Top secret?

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:06.530
Geez...

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.200
Rena must be fed up, too.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:11.830
Rena? Why?

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:14.920
The real issue here is with her.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:15.210
We can't continue to cover
up the fight with that giant.

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:21.590
We need to come up with a plan.

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:21.880
Despite there being no injuries
or deaths at the pier battle,

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.760
And there is no guarantee
that this one will be the last.

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:34.190
Yes... If what Rena fears is true...

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:41.110
There's something I'd like you two to see.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.820
This is...

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:49.240
It was taken 12 years ago,
in the Kingdom of Rimgarde.

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:51.540
The Fall of Rimgarde...

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:02.290
The people of Rimgarde disappeared overnight.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:05.550
Our country, and others around the world,

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:08.140
initiated rescue and support operations,

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:12.850
but we were unable to find
a single person to help.

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:17.190
These giants were the only clue left behind.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:20.020
And the one that just appeared in our country

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:21.860
looks frighteningly similar.

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:24.190
However, whether or not they
are the same thing remains--

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:26.610
They are the same.

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:30.120
Rena! How do you know that?

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.410
Because that's me.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:39.460
That day... I was there.

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:42.380
The giant and I are the same thing.

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:48.550
Regalia... That's what we
were called, a long time ago.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:06:00.230
Before I ever met Yui, this was
the form in which I lived.

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:03.150
So, the fight at the pier...?

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:05.820
That was me fighting.

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:07.360
I don't believe it.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:13.450
The other one... Was that a Regalia, like you?

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:18.160
I don't think so. The pilot
called it a Regalia Gear.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:20.540
Regalia Gear...

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.750
The fact that there was a person piloting it

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:26.970
means that this was some kind
of willfully conducted attack.

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:28.550
You're absolutely right.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:32.300
They said they had come to take me away.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.060
Why you?

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:40.140
I don't know. But I'm sure they'll be back.

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:46.650
I'm the one that has gotten
Yui involved. I'm truly sorry.

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:49.450
Rena“.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.410
It's all very hard to accept...

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:57.620
Given what she said, it's clear
that she has some connection

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:00.330
with the giants.

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:03.080
And Yui was there as well.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:05.250
What about the connection
with the Fall of Rimgarde?

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:08.050
I don't know.

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:10.970
Did the empress dowager know about this?

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:15.680
I'm sorry, we never discussed it.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:17.930
Ah.

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:21.890
May I ask for your thoughts on the matter, Yui?

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.850
I trust Rena.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:28.440
And I don't care what the reason is--

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:30.530
we must not let her be taken away!

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:34.780
Yet it would be a problem
if they attacked again.

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:37.700
Our armed forces are on high alert...

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.580
But, if they attack suddenly
like they did yesterday,

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.410
there is little we can do to prevent it.

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:44.710
Does that mean the army or the
city will be damaged this time?

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:46.420
That's...

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:54.050
If we are forced to fight...

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:57.100
I doubt we'll solve this problem right now.

00:07:57.310 --> 00:08:00.890
Yui appears to be tired.
That will be all for today.

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:03.770
For now, let's make sure that
the things we heard from Rena

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.520
are not shared outside of this room.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:10.150
Even if we talked, nobody would believe us.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:12.900
We'll meet again tomorrow morning

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:16.910
and establish a plan based on Yui's decision.

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:20.660
Yui, please consider this carefully.

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.170
Yui!

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:32.130
Sorry about that. I didn't mean to cut you off.

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:35.130
It's okay. If I had gone and
said I'd fight alongside Rena,

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:37.970
it would have been a bit awkward for everyone.

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:42.060
We don't want to make it awkward for you, either.

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:43.890
I know.

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:49.320
Yui, are you okay? Do you
want to talk a little more?

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:53.070
Thank you. But I'm fine.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:57.780
After all, I'm Yuinshiel Asteria,
Empress of Enastoria!

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:01.910
Is this a good spot?

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:03.450
Thanks!

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:06.790
All right, we're finally here!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.290
I wanna eat dinner!

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:11.340
We've gotta set up camp first!

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:13.510
Let's see... This should be fine.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:14.880
Ya)!

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:26.730
Is it okay for me to be here?

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:28.270
Of course it is!

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:32.530
But I might cause more trouble for everyone.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:41.490
It's okay. It'll be okay.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:56.420
Thanks for coming, Retty!

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:59.970
I'm always happy to have a chance to see you!

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:03.140
But never mind that--are you okay?

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:04.430
Yui...

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.270
What is it, Retty?

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:09.690
You're in a bit of trouble, you know that?

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:10.850
"Her Three Sizes, Revealed!"
"Top Secrets
Leaked at the Q&A?!"
"An Alluring Body"

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:15.820
"Massive orders for clothes and
underwear in Yui's sizes!"

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:19.910
I understand with women, but even
men are buying them! Crazy, huh?

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:22.870
I wonder what they're all looking at...

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:25.910
Did your chest get a bit bigger?

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:27.750
Retty!

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:34.800
I get it. You want to look out for Renny,

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:38.840
but as Empress, you've got
to think of your citizens, too.

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:41.300
What should I do?

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:46.010
The Empress has to think
about everyone. That must be rough.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:51.730
But Renny's just like me, isn't she?

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:56.440
I mean, Renny is just another one of
the people that you want to look out for.

00:10:58.030 --> 00:11:00.110
Right?

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:02.700
You're... right.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:04.070
Thought so!

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:06.330
Thanks, Retty!

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:10.330
I think you knew what you wanted
to do before you asked me!

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:16.500
But, if it helps you feel better,
it's fine with me.

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:17.880
All right...

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:19.720
Retty!

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:26.180
I'm really glad I'm your friend.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:34.480
Yui, let's get married!

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:38.110
--Just kidding, just kidding!
--Retty?

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:42.530
I'm gonna get going. I know
you must be pretty busy!

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:46.410
Okay, bring Renny along next time! See ya!

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:49.540
See ya...

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:07.760
May I sit with you, Your Highness?

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:16.360
Your battle in the Regalia was wonderful.

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:19.230
It's hard to believe it was your first time.

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:22.700
And yet, the damage was more than we expected.

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:26.950
We had no intention of
causing this country trouble.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.280
Who are you?

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:31.200
Ingrid. I am Your Highness' enemy...

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:33.660
...or so you might say.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:37.250
Allow me to get right to the point.

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:40.500
Hand your Regalia over to us.

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:44.050
If you do, the cause of our enmity will disappear.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:48.600
As will the danger threatening
this country, of course.

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:51.470
How about it? The answer is really quite clear.

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:53.060
I don't think so.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:54.560
Oh, really?

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:57.560
Rena is a very special person to me.

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:01.480
Person? That thing is not human.

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:07.200
That doesn't change the fact that she is my sister.

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.870
You are free to think so.

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:12.750
But do you think you can
hold on to both the Regalia

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:14.710
and the citizens of Enastoria?

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:18.580
Rena is a citizen, and I must protect her.

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:23.290
I see. So, that is the type of
Empress you wish to be.

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:29.550
It has been an honor to speak
with you, Empress Yuinshiel.

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:34.260
I look forward to seeing whether or not
you can maintain your convictions.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:37.190
Good day.

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:00.250
Hey!

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.670
You're from earlier...

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:05.260
Terribly sorry for the
strange question yesterday,

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:06.880
Your Highness.

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:11.590
We'd be upset if you talked about
the Regalia too much, you see?

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:17.100
I didn't think you'd actually
tell us your three sizes!

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:19.980
Is Your Highness into that kind of thing?

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:24.020
You're so cute when you blush!

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:25.190
Who are you guys?

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:29.900
I am Jonny Mabett. And this
is my assistant, Johann.

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:35.290
We've come to invite
Your Highness to a magic show.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:38.750
It's a spectacular show time! Full of thrills!

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:41.830
Naturally, the star of the show... is you.

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.340
Ingrid is very nice, eh?

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:51.510
Saying how they didn't mean
to damage the city and stuff...

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:55.560
We would really love for you to come!

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:57.350
Oh, and Rena, was it?

00:14:57.560 --> 00:15:00.140
Be sure to bring that Regalia with you.

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:01.350
Goodbye.

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:11.610
Rena! We don't have to listen
to what those guys said!

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:14.780
They're going to try to take you away again!

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.500
You're the Empress.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:22.540
You've got to think of everyone else first, not me.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:23.920
I know that!

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:28.630
I do care about everyone, but I care about you, too.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.470
Yui...

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:36.180
You're one of them. You're one
of the people I care about.

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:43.150
It's going to be okay.

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:47.850
They've called the two of you out. Isn't that right?

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:53.400
Yes. Since Rena is their target, it will
be difficult to negotiate with them.

00:15:56.410 --> 00:16:00.540
We will immediately assemble a
joint task force to intercept them.

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:05.250
Thank you. But, against a Regalia Gear...

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:08.050
What will you do?

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:12.470
I will go. With Rena.

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.760
If you're going, then I--

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:18.930
I'm sorry, Aoi. But I must go.

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:20.600
Yui...

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:29.600
lam the Empress of Enastoria.
I must think of everyone first.

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:34.740
But if I let go of Rena's hand now,

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:37.660
I will lose something very dear to me.

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:42.370
I will no longer be able stand
proudly before you, as Empress.

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:48.080
Margaret, everyone. I am sorry
to be selfish. But please...

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:54.930
This is how I feel.

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:03.890
I will protect Yui.

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:07.940
Rena?

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:18.660
Rena, we ask that you take care of Yui.

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:30.960
Thank you, everyone.

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:34.300
We'll be going, then.

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:38.840
Is this really the right choice?

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:43.550
Would you want to serve Yui if
she were willing to abandon Rena?

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:49.150
But, if something were to happen to Yui...

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:53.030
It's possible that we have made the wrong decision.

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:57.730
But whatever happens, we stand with Yui.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:02.790
For Yui... for Enastoria...

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:05.660
We will give our all!

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:11.590
Wow, the Empress and the Regalia show up all alone.

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:14.630
This country is really something.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:20.760
Welcome to Jonny and Johann's magic show!

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:25.470
I've got a lot more questions
to ask you after our fight!

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:29.520
It's show time!

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:42.620
Rena“.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:46.160
It's okay. I will protect you.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:15.650
Is it true... The two of them...

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:21.030
Okay. Rapid response teams are all in position.

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:23.620
Yui... Rena...

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:26.030
Are you ready?

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:30.740
It's Jonny and Johann's magic show!
First up, flourishes!

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.960
Spring and throw!

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:43.140
Now, try to concentrate...

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:45.100
We've got to get closer.

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:49.730
Oh, what a pickle!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:51.100
Try to pick the right one!

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:53.560
This is child's play!

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:59.320
Too bad!

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:01.240
You missed!

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:05.450
Next up, billiard ball magic!

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:08.120
Hey, hey. hey. hey!

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:10.290
Blaze up!

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.250
Is that it?

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:17.500
I won't let you get away.

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:23.760
That was a close one!

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:27.760
And now, an illusion!

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:30.720
Smoke?

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:33.810
There he is!

00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:37.310
They're all real!

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:39.230
Are there more?!

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:49.870
They're gone.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.750
Take this!

00:21:12.390 --> 00:21:14.270
Behind you!

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.770
Rena, are you okay?

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:21.690
Don't worry. I'll protect you!

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:26.530
More, please!

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:27.910
Coming "P!

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:33.040
Thank you for your patience!

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:40.540
Presenting today's main event!

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:45.800
An inescapable magic box!

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:48.720
Unless they make a miraculous
escape in the next three minutes,

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:51.390
there's going to be a
great thundering explosion!

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:55.020
The poor, lovely Empress will be torn apart!

00:21:57.600 --> 00:21:59.900
If the Empress doesn't put in the proper effort,

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:02.480
she'll find herself in a real mess.
